[00:00.00]It is so hot.|天太热了。
[00:06.00]Let's make mung bean soup.|我们来做绿豆汤吧。
[00:08.00]Great! Grandma!|太好了，奶奶！
[00:15.00]Look! The beans are getting big!|你看！豆子变大了！
[00:18.00]Wait! We'll cook them later.|等等！我们待会儿再煮。
[00:26.00]Add more sugar, please!|请再多加点糖！
[00:29.00]Okay, it will be sweet.|好，会甜甜的。
[00:36.00]Wow, it smells so sweet.|哇，闻起来好甜呀。
[00:40.00]Be careful, it is very hot.|小心，很烫的。
[00:48.00]Ooh, the water is cold.|哦，水好凉。
[00:52.00]Let's cool the soup here.|我们把汤放这儿晾凉吧。
[00:55.00]Yay, the soup is cool!|耶，汤凉啦！
[00:59.00]This soup is so yummy!|这汤真好喝！
[01:02.56]Yes, it is nice and cool.|是啊，又香又凉爽。
